{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14862","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"zbUw5PyVsdccbgDTRHg7d","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Naive Byes\n\nNaive Bayes is a probabilistic classification algorithm based on Bayes' theorem, with the assumption that features are independent of each other given the class. Despite this simplifying assumption, it performs well in practice for text classification, spam detection, and other categorical problems. It is fast to train and works well with small datasets.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What are Na├»ve Bayes classifiers?","url":"https://www.ibm.com/topics/naive-bayes","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a69"},{"type":"article","title":"Naive Bayes","url":"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a6a"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/zbUw5PyVsdccbgDTRHg7d.md"}